579
00:28:26,440 --> 00:28:27,220
are filled with things

580
00:28:27,220 --> 00:28:28,040
that we think

581
00:28:28,040 --> 00:28:29,440
are under our control

582
00:28:29,440 --> 00:28:30,080
and reality,

583
00:28:30,080 --> 00:28:31,180
it's all things

584
00:28:31,180 --> 00:28:32,240
that God is sovereign over

585
00:28:32,240 --> 00:28:33,600
and God's inviting us

586
00:28:33,600 --> 00:28:34,080
to surrender

587
00:28:34,080 --> 00:28:34,980
those things to Him.

588
00:28:34,980 --> 00:28:36,880
So what things

589
00:28:36,880 --> 00:28:37,860
are outside of your authority?

590
00:28:37,860 --> 00:28:38,320
What things

591
00:28:38,320 --> 00:28:39,560
are you taking ownership of?

592
00:28:39,560 --> 00:28:41,480
Surrender it to God

593
00:28:41,480 --> 00:28:42,080
intentionally

594
00:28:42,080 --> 00:28:43,480
and enter His presence

595
00:28:43,480 --> 00:28:45,160
even just for a few moments.

596
00:28:45,160 --> 00:28:48,780
Actively acknowledging

597
00:28:48,780 --> 00:28:50,020
everything in your mind

598
00:28:50,020 --> 00:28:50,520
and your heart,

599
00:28:50,520 --> 00:28:51,600
not hiding from it,

600
00:28:51,600 --> 00:28:53,180
not burying it,

601
00:28:53,180 --> 00:28:54,780
bringing it to God.

602
00:28:54,780 --> 00:28:56,260
And here's the cool thing

603
00:28:56,260 --> 00:28:57,040
about this stage.

604
00:28:57,040 --> 00:28:58,580
Surrender is going to repeat

605
00:28:58,580 --> 00:28:59,080
through the rest

606
00:28:59,080 --> 00:28:59,600
of the stages

607
00:28:59,600 --> 00:29:01,300
because you're going to get

608
00:29:01,300 --> 00:29:01,920
to the time

609
00:29:01,920 --> 00:29:02,800
where you're contemplating

610
00:29:02,800 --> 00:29:04,160
all the things of God

611
00:29:04,160 --> 00:29:05,360
and guess what's going to happen?

612
00:29:05,360 --> 00:29:07,220
The distractions

613
00:29:07,220 --> 00:29:08,640
that you surrendered yourself to

614
00:29:08,640 --> 00:29:10,260
like 30 seconds ago

615
00:29:10,260 --> 00:29:11,540
