616
00:29:11,540 --> 00:29:12,840
And then,

617
00:29:12,840 --> 00:29:14,000
then you're going to feel defeated.

618
00:29:14,000 --> 00:29:15,800
Then you're going to feel discouraged.

619
00:29:15,800 --> 00:29:17,120
Then you're going to feel like

620
00:29:17,120 --> 00:29:17,660
I'm a failure.

621
00:29:17,660 --> 00:29:18,500
I can't pray.

622
00:29:18,500 --> 00:29:20,280
And guess what?

623
00:29:20,280 --> 00:29:22,280
Don't feel that way.

624
00:29:22,280 --> 00:29:24,700
I heard another quote.

625
00:29:24,700 --> 00:29:25,780
I couldn't find the source

626
00:29:25,780 --> 00:29:26,300
for this one.

627
00:29:26,300 --> 00:29:27,240
I really wanted to find it

628
00:29:27,240 --> 00:29:27,920
because it's great.

629
00:29:27,920 --> 00:29:28,840
They said,

630
00:29:28,840 --> 00:29:30,520
don't view constant distractions

631
00:29:30,520 --> 00:29:31,060
