636
00:29:37,140 --> 00:29:39,480
As you go along this process,

637
00:29:39,480 --> 00:29:40,800
as worry and fear

638
00:29:40,800 --> 00:29:41,840
keep coming back,

639
00:29:41,840 --> 00:29:43,360
and even if you chase

640
00:29:43,360 --> 00:29:44,020
the rabbit hole

641
