642
00:29:44,980 --> 00:29:46,160
thinking about all the ways

643
00:29:46,160 --> 00:29:46,720
in which you need

644
00:29:46,720 --> 00:29:47,500
to do different things

645
00:29:47,500 --> 00:29:48,480
to get rid of the stress,

646
00:29:48,480 --> 00:29:50,760
when you snap back into it

647
00:29:50,760 --> 00:29:51,580
and you realize

648
00:29:51,580 --> 00:29:52,620
that you're being distracted,

649
00:29:52,620 --> 00:29:53,820
bring it to God.

650
00:29:53,820 --> 00:29:54,840
God,

651
00:29:54,840 --> 00:29:55,720
I was just distracted

652
00:29:55,720 --> 00:29:56,420
for five minutes

653
00:29:56,420 --> 00:29:56,980
thinking about

654
00:29:56,980 --> 00:29:58,080
