655
00:29:58,080 --> 00:29:58,780
has enough money.

656
00:29:59,500 --> 00:30:00,140
and I know

657
00:30:00,140 --> 00:30:01,140
that that's not something

658
00:30:01,140 --> 00:30:01,620
that's worthy

659
00:30:01,620 --> 00:30:02,260
