660
00:30:02,260 --> 00:30:03,100
so I'm bringing it

661
00:30:03,100 --> 00:30:03,780
back to your feet.

662
00:30:03,780 --> 00:30:04,500
You are sovereign

663
00:30:04,500 --> 00:30:05,220
and in control.

664
00:30:05,220 --> 00:30:05,880
I trust you.

665
00:30:05,880 --> 00:30:07,480
All right?

666
00:30:07,480 --> 00:30:08,620
So,

667
00:30:08,620 --> 00:30:09,680
start by pausing,

668
00:30:09,680 --> 00:30:10,420
