670
00:30:11,400 --> 00:30:13,060
surrender your anxious thoughts.

671
00:30:14,760 --> 00:30:15,160
Now,

672
00:30:15,160 --> 00:30:16,480
we contemplate.

673
00:30:16,480 --> 00:30:18,340
We contemplate.

674
00:30:18,340 --> 00:30:19,520
We think about God.

675
00:30:19,520 --> 00:30:20,260
Now that our minds

676
00:30:20,260 --> 00:30:20,740
and our hearts

677
00:30:20,740 --> 00:30:21,920
are absence of distraction

678
00:30:21,920 --> 00:30:22,880
