679
00:30:22,880 --> 00:30:24,440
we focus our minds on God.

680
00:30:24,440 --> 00:30:25,200
This is a great time

681
00:30:25,200 --> 00:30:26,060
for Lectio Divina

682
00:30:26,060 --> 00:30:26,800
if that's something

683
00:30:26,800 --> 00:30:28,160
that works for you.

684
00:30:28,160 --> 00:30:30,060
We think about

685
00:30:30,060 --> 00:30:31,200
who God is to us

686
00:30:31,200 --> 00:30:32,720
and who we are to God.

687
00:30:32,720 --> 00:30:33,820
I love Psalm chapter one.

688
00:30:33,820 --> 00:30:34,520
It says,

689
00:30:34,680 --> 00:30:58,480
It's this time

690
00:30:58,480 --> 00:30:59,180
of meditation,

691
00:30:59,180 --> 00:31:00,440
thinking about,

692
00:31:00,440 --> 00:31:01,920
thinking about the Scriptures.

693
00:31:01,920 --> 00:31:03,060
This is why Bible reading,

694
00:31:03,060 --> 00:31:04,260
regular Bible reading

695
00:31:04,260 --> 00:31:05,360
