Is this consistent

708
00:31:19,300 --> 00:31:19,780
with Scripture?

709
00:31:21,720 --> 00:31:24,200
So we think about God.

710
00:31:24,200 --> 00:31:24,940
We meditate on God.

711
00:31:24,940 --> 00:31:26,200
Think about his faithfulness.

712
00:31:26,200 --> 00:31:28,300
We started a prayer rhythm

713
00:31:28,300 --> 00:31:29,040
