748
00:32:12,240 --> 00:32:15,840
Think about God's faithfulness.

749
00:32:15,840 --> 00:32:18,860
Think about God's love for you.

750
00:32:20,720 --> 00:32:21,760
Colossians 3, 2 says,

751
00:32:21,760 --> 00:32:22,760
think about the things

752
00:32:22,760 --> 00:32:23,140
of heaven,

753
00:32:23,140 --> 00:32:24,060
not the things

754
00:32:24,060 --> 00:32:25,560
