778
00:32:50,920 --> 00:32:51,600
His love for you,

779
00:32:51,600 --> 00:32:52,540
His patience towards you,

780
00:32:52,540 --> 00:32:53,580
His kindness

781
00:32:53,580 --> 00:32:56,220
is far more

782
00:32:56,220 --> 00:32:56,840
than we ever

783
00:32:56,840 --> 00:32:58,140
