784
00:32:58,140 --> 00:33:02,340
As we spend time

785
00:33:02,340 --> 00:33:03,120
contemplating

786
00:33:03,120 --> 00:33:03,660
and examining

787
00:33:03,660 --> 00:33:04,620
our thoughts about God

788
00:33:04,620 --> 00:33:05,220
and His thoughts

789
00:33:05,220 --> 00:33:05,820
