00:33:26,260 --> 00:33:26,960
No offense, guys.

802
00:33:26,960 --> 00:33:27,760
I love you.

803
00:33:27,760 --> 00:33:28,560
I really do.

804
00:33:28,560 --> 00:33:29,160
I love you guys.

805
00:33:29,160 --> 00:33:30,920
I'm right there with you.

806
00:33:30,920 --> 00:33:31,660
But it talked about

807
00:33:31,660 --> 00:33:33,120
